AI-assisted memory64 adaptation of raylib 6.0's web canvas initialization.
The original zlib license and source notices remain unchanged.
JS typed-array/string helpers use Number offsets; EM_JS pointer arguments are
BigInt under memory64. Number also preserves the existing wasm32 behavior.

--- a/src/platforms/rcore_web.c
+++ b/src/platforms/rcore_web.c
@@ -149,5 +149,5 @@
 // JS: Set the canvas id provided by the module configuration
 EM_JS(void, SetCanvasIdJs, (char *out, int outSize), {
     var canvasId = "#" + Module.canvas.id;
-    stringToUTF8(canvasId, out, outSize);
+    stringToUTF8(canvasId, Number(out), outSize);
 });
